OL,3,AFifty arrests in crime probe after
OL,4,Afatal A66 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 50 people have now been
OL,7,Farrested as part of a wider police
OL,8,Foperation against organised crime
OL,9,Ffollowing a fatal crash.
OL,11,FThe arrests have been made after the
OL,12,Fhead-on smash on the A66 on Teesside
OL,13,Fwhich killed seven people, including
OL,14,Ftwo police officers.
OL,16,FTen of the 50 arrested are alleged to
OL,17,Fbe linked to the Volvo reportedly
OL,18,Finvolved in driving into two properties
OL,19,Fin the early hours of 22 August, police
OL,20,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
