OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFifty arrests in crime probe after
OL,4,Afatal A66 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Sup Helen Barker of Cleveland
OL,7,FPolice, said: "Over the last two
OL,8,Fmonths, we have identified 50 people
OL,9,Fwho we believe are associated within
OL,10,Fcriminal networks that seek to cause
OL,11,Fserious violence and harm within the
OL,12,Fcommunity through the supply of drugs."
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
